        "created_at": "2016-02-19T10:01:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Fun fact: when I’m not writing, refreshing these forums, or counting how many letters are in a word (and then getting cranky if it’s not 9) I have a podcast!</p>\n<p>My ex-fiancee and I post a new one every week. We talk about our relationship (we had a pretty explosive breakup), love, life, creativity, and mental health stuff. It’s pretty good and if any of that sounds interesting, you should listen to it:</p>\n<p><span class=\"bbcode-b\"><a href=\"http://www.beinghonestwithmyex.com\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Being Honest With My Ex</a></span></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
